OL,3,GNEWSATeen was at significant risk
OL,4,Abefore death - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 14-year-old boy was at "significant
OL,7,Frisk" with a history of self-harm when
OL,8,Fhe was found dead in his bedroom at
OL,9,Fhome, a report said.
OL,11,FScotty Kenneth Henniker from Essex made
OL,12,Fseveral suicide attempts before he died
OL,13,Fon 24 September 2023.
OL,15,FA Prevention of Future Deaths report
OL,16,Fsaid Henniker's previous attempts had
OL,17,Fnot been "appropriately recorded" in
OL,18,Fthe records or shared among
OL,19,Fprofessionals.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
