OL,3,GNEWSATeen was at significant risk
OL,4,Abefore death - report
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Scotty was never offered any adapted
OL,7,Ftherapy as a child with autism and ADHD
OL,8,Fwhere his cognitive understanding was
OL,9,Flower than his chronological age," the
OL,10,Freport added.
